# "Gain control of that Equipment until end of turn. Attach it to the chosen creature. When you lose control of that
# Equipment this turn, if it's attached to a creature you control, unattach it." Bot1 takes Bot2's Skullclamp onto its
# Grizzly Bears (3/1). In the cleanup step the "until end of turn" control ends and the "this turn" delayed ability ends
# at the same moment (CR 514.2); the ruling: it triggers "whether it's because the 'until end of turn' duration ended or
# because someone else gained control of the Equipment". It does, Bot1 gets priority in that cleanup step (CR 514.3a),
# and the Skullclamp comes off: on turn 4 Bot2 has it back unattached and the Bears are 2/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Grizzly Bears
Stolen Uniform
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Skullclamp
Mountain x18

